{"unit_id":"tag:023M:statement","translation":"假设<MATH_0001>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的，见代数（Algebra），定义<REF_0001>。那么，对任意<MATH_0002>-模（module）<MATH_0003>，扩充的上链（cochain）复形（complex）（<REF_0002>）是正合（exact）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"环映射的忠实平坦性。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用的代数章。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"底环上的模。"},{"source_term":"cochain","target_term":"上链","context":"扩充上链复形。"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"由典范下降数据给出的复形。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"扩充复形的正合性。"}],"notes":[]}
